  "x_guidance": "# Bloomfilter — Domain Registration and Configuration API\n\nRegister ICANN domains (.com, .io, .ai, etc.) and manage DNS records, paying with USDC via x402.\n\n## Endpoints\n\n| Method | Endpoint | Price | Description |\n|--------|----------|-------|-------------|\n| POST | /domains/register | Dynamic | Register a domain |\n| POST | /domains/renew | Dynamic | Renew a domain |\n| POST | /dns/{domain} | $0.10 | Add a DNS record |\n| PUT | /dns/{domain}/{recordId} | $0.10 | Update a DNS record |\n| DELETE | /dns/{domain}/{recordId} | $0.10 | Delete a DNS record |\n\n## Free Endpoints\n\n| Method | Endpoint | Description |\n|--------|----------|-------------|\n| GET | /domains/search?query=...&tlds=... | Search domain availability |\n| GET | /domains/pricing | Get all TLD pricing |\n| GET | /domains/{domain} | Get domain info |\n\nDocs: https://docs.bloomfilter.xyz",
